 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "KVStore() starts empty. set(key, value) inserts a new key; update(key, value) overwrites an existing key; get(key) returns the value or -1 when absent; deleteKey(key) removes the key when present (no effect otherwise). The preview's error cases are excluded from the domain: set is only called for absent keys and update only for present keys. prefixSearch(prefix) returns the values of all present keys starting with prefix (the empty prefix matches every key), ordered by key in ascending code-point order. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk11-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
